sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin
  participant B as cephadm on node1
  participant M as MON + MGR
  participant H as other nodes
  A->>B: cephadm bootstrap --mon-ip
  B->>B: check prerequisites, pull the image
  B->>M: create MON and MGR in containers
  B->>A: ceph.conf, admin keyring and SSH key
  A->>H: ssh-copy-id with ceph.pub
  A->>M: ceph orch host add
  M->>H: deploy daemons over SSH
  A->>M: ceph orch apply osd
  M->>H: ceph-volume on the free disks
